{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "52896aa7c00682bd59e4376ce52fe4b9b448fec7d4780f0534e161a7ca97eaf3", "ja": "（今日の仕事はレジャー施設のイベント出演だ。\n響は空き時間に、少し遊ばせてもらったのだが……）", "zh": "（今天的工作是参加休闲设施的活动演出。\n响在空闲时间玩了一会儿，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0f8a87756f3350e705d54a5601c89268576c68c92846b6af5cd421d8bb918837", "ja": "ぜぇ、はぁ……。ぜぇ、はぁ……ウグッ！", "zh": "呼……哈……呼……哈……呜呃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "3ec19034a7a9523458285b8aac210dc632a6ae4f9c6916f61c5ca6d1bb0ee0ef", "ja": "{$P$}、大丈夫？　自分、\n楽しくて、つい本気で遊んじゃったけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}，你没事吧？我觉得很开心，一不小心就玩得太投入了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "e6694b161d68af45d99fbeca76c6322c12537d4c3cb1bb6d90c86794aa2bc7a8", "ja": "疲れたなら、ちょっと休憩する？\nはい、自分が持って来たさんぴん茶。飲んで！", "zh": "要是累了，要不要稍微休息一下？\n来，这是我带来的茉莉花茶。喝吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aa382649e37cf72ec708c452dd07a788efb365f5bfdd929ca2575e8dea87ed0a", "ja": "ああ、ありがとう……ふぅ。\nやっぱり響は凄いな。毎日レッスンしてるからかな？", "zh": "啊，谢谢……呼。\n响果然很厉害啊。是因为每天都在练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "d6020e276411a94484a2baa073d57404a7fdc669fad15a8e8dbf20261879bd7b", "ja": "ふふん、これくらい余裕だぞ！　それに\nアイドルになる前は、海でよく遊んでたからね。", "zh": "哼哼，这点小事根本难不倒我！而且在成为偶像之前，我经常在海边玩呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "d5d4ad9c63b7b8d9c33e3312f1ddfa2df257883b83b60580e61b463c46815a98", "ja": "友達と浜辺に集まって、日が暮れるまで……\n楽しかったな～。", "zh": "和朋友们聚在海边，一直玩到天黑……真开心啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f1b1a6ce029489a09cd0ee0dc100132503890ba1ce1402718dbd96c983898507", "ja": "沖縄の友達か……。\nどんな事して遊んでたんだ？", "zh": "冲绳的朋友啊……你们都玩些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "c669eec407e018e8e6b4d4b811cd7e9a440ce7d4a3836281dddc23c55076f1d3", "ja": "えっと、泳ぐことが多かったかな？　あとは砂浜で\n追いかけっことか、岩場でかくれんぼとか……。", "zh": "呃，我们以前经常游泳吧？还有在沙滩上玩追逐游戏，或者在岩石滩上玩捉迷藏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "34697097d6df83ae35c4b2ea15122c691e4bc9b95b628af3d74c470e4fdf350f", "ja": "あ、あとエイサーも踊ったぞ！\n放課後、みんなで集まって練習して……。", "zh": "啊，还有跳过艾萨舞哦！\n放学后，大家聚在一起练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "1453cc5148643a8866394254765dee6fcab556c1c1225b5270ff72502f4bf040", "ja": "学校の発表会にも出たんだ。\nもちろん、本番はカンペキだったさー！", "zh": "还参加了学校的发表会呢。\n正式演出的时候当然也是完美发挥啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1011_p", "source_sha256": "35cf107af89584a52475b0d656b1c2c64d09e7ca891a1bc8543e6e1e9c41ab02", "ja": "エイサー、お盆に踊ったりするんだったな。\n響の発表会、見てみたかったな。", "zh": "Eisa舞是在盂兰盆节跳的舞吧。\n真想看看响的发表会啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "23857d382531c6934652045ec42046985dd361cf49285573e828a426a9a00d73", "ja": "{$P$}、興味があるの？\nなら、自分が教えてあげる！", "zh": "{$P$}，你感兴趣吗？\n那就让我来教你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "84f9dc28f2834cadd2a1ba74cec73418fcb6727c795bf353ff99c426a5d5f184", "ja": "見るのも楽しいけど、踊った方が\nもっと楽しいからね！　イーヤーサーサー♪", "zh": "光是看也很开心，但亲自跳的话\n会更开心哦！　伊呀萨萨♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0b928dafbc5808d3d0155816e35175bbe7c4c07cbce9b612d2683d6528e658c8", "ja": "えっ。まあ、興味ない事もないけど……。", "zh": "诶。倒也不是完全没兴趣，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "a48e446f3fc4458d198d0487aaf8de71c888baf06c804a3d36c71f77b850f285", "ja": "あっ、でも{$P$}の場合は、\n体力づくりからかな？　激しい動きもあるし……。", "zh": "啊，不过如果是{$P$}的话，\n还是先从锻炼体力开始吧？毕竟也有很多激烈的动作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "3306030751d6404edabc486c31481673b2ae462621febb584020205ce8c97898", "ja": "自分、こうみえて教える時はスパルタだから。\n覚悟してよね！", "zh": "我看起来虽然这样，但教人的时候可是斯巴达式的。做好心理准备哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1017_p", "source_sha256": "97d82e349f8b1b3db93a93665cbd6d9c2301e2bc2ca469d15f15a3999f670dbb", "ja": "そ、そうなのか……わかった。\n運動不足解消のためにも、お願いしようかな？", "zh": "这、这样啊……知道了。\n那为了改善运动不足，就拜托你了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "72837e51fc4efedd7cdc056c7aa333ea474951ce826bab4be40de2d9f74136d1", "ja": "まかせて！　沖縄で踊っても恥ずかしくないくらい、\nカンペキにしてあげるから。", "zh": "交给我吧！我会把你训练到就算在冲绳跳舞也不会觉得害羞的完美程度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "646fd8dd39d7183d518ccb5f13737008e44aec1d8d57acf9dd7d8bfd8aeac9b0", "ja": "それじゃ、まずは走り込みからね！\n……いくぞーっ！", "zh": "那么，先从跑步训练开始吧！\n……出发——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1020_p", "source_sha256": "18494bda4dcc62ea3d507caeb32a3c82cc0c67dd5427a2601a83ee90760b9641", "ja": "ま、待ってくれ、響！\n今はまだ、仕事中だから！", "zh": "等、等等，响！\n现在还在工作呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b04bd7a612e58ef56363adf2e0c8763e275f1eb4723e4c2d7ef4f126dfce507", "ja": "あっ、そうだった……。\nなら、劇場に帰ってから練習だね。", "zh": "啊，对哦……  \n那就回剧场后再练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "2ccefc9505e5c4264f6ae603e54ed09db3a2a1ba76fa0950b503692c5dd23ab3", "ja": "もちろん、仕事をカンペキにこなしてからね。\n楽しみだな～、{$P$}のエイサー！", "zh": "当然要先把工作完美完成才行。\n真期待啊～{$P$}的阿伊萨！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0214_1023_p", "source_sha256": "481f686ef6963a2d2ae6bc8b55c648807e8b8879c8dfbd63a06432860c1e8796", "ja": "（その後、響は本当に完璧な仕事をしてみせた。\nこれは、覚悟を決めないとな……イーヤーサーサー！）", "zh": "（之后，响真的完美地完成了工作。\n看来我也得做好心理准备了……伊亚萨萨！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
